      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَقِذَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَقَذَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَقَذٌ</span>; (Msb, K;) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَقَذَ</span>,
(A, L,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَقُذَ</span></b> , (L,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَقْذٌ</span>; (A, L;) <i>He
became safe, in safety, saved,</i> or <i>liberated; he
escaped.</i> (A, L, Msb, K.) ― 
